  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nLet’s be upfront: this unique older home is rough, rundown, and needs a total makeover from top to bottom. If you're looking for an easy move in, this isn't it. But if you’re a builder, tradie, or fearless renovator who isn't afraid of hard work, the raw material here is absolute gold.\r\n\r\nOn a 869m2 site opposite Alice Eaves Bush Reserve and just 6 minutes' walk from Orewa beach, this block and brick home has good bones and some gorgeous character: unique, original decorative interior details waiting to be restored! It's big and with offstreet parking and an oversize separate double plus garage, there's room for the boat, the cars and your hobbies.\r\n\r\nBring your trades people and your plan. Opportunities to secure a property and build equity in this loved street near the beach don't come around often. \r\n\r\nProperty Features At A Glance:\r\n\r\n• Prized Full-Sized Section: Rare land size with potential for landscaping or outdoor living.\r\n• Major Renovation Project: Needs a full top-to-bottom overhaul - buyer cannot be afraid of hard work!\r\n• Authentic Character: Beautiful, unique decorative interior details waiting for a second life.\r\n• Location: Peaceful street away from main roads, just a short, flat walk to the beach.\r\n• Roll up your sleeves, gather your tradies, and contact us today to inspect the site and explore the potential.\r\n\r\nCome and live the Coast lifestyle in this prime location. Walk to Orewa's Boulevard of cafes, bars and restaurants. Launch the boat of Hatfields Beach boat ramp - it's all here waiting for you.",
